        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>业务综述 财产保险业务</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1100px;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #3f3d3d;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 1654px;\n      min-height: 2339px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 70px 118px 45px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 65px;\n      line-height: 1.17;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      color: #242122;\n    }\n    .title .orange {\n      display: block;\n      color: #f65b16;\n    }\n    .section-heading {\n      margin: 162px 0 28px;\n      color: #008246;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .top-rule,\n    .row {\n      border-top: 2px solid #f65b16;\n    }\n    .top-rule {\n      height: 39px;\n    }\n    .row {\n      min-height: 339px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 330px 1fr;\n      column-gap: 47px;\n      padding: 51px 0 42px;\n    }\n    .row.compact {\n      min-height: 276px;\n      padding-top: 47px;\n      padding-bottom: 37px;\n    }\n    .icon-area {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding-top: 18px;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      width: 117px;\n      height: 117px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f85d17;\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      padding: 12px;\n    }\n    .label {\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      color: #4a4848;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .content {\n      padding-top: 0;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 300;\n      line-height: 1.62;\n      color: #4a4848;\n    }\n    .content p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    .content .bullet {\n      position: relative;\n      padding-left: 24px;\n    }\n    .content .bullet::before {\n      content: \"⊙\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: 0;\n      color: #f65b16;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n    }\n    footer {\n      border-top: 1.5px solid #f65b16;\n      margin-top: 0;\n      padding-top: 29px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #343232;\n    }\n    .footer-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      gap: 32px;\n    }\n    .page-number {\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n    .report {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #f65b16;\n    }\n    .company {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #5a5757;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">业务综述<span class=\"orange\">财产保险业务</span></h1>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">分险种经营数据</h2>\n    <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n\n    <section class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：车险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">车险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入2,233.01亿元，同比增长4.4%；综合成本率98.1%，同比上升0.3个百分点，主要受新保险合同准则下的贴现率下降带来的负债成本上升和暴雨等自然灾害同比多发影响。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">积极践行投行合一，持续深化精细化能力建设，聚焦新能源板块重点突破，整体经营稳健有序；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">积极探索风险减量服务，不断完善新能源专属定价模型、理赔体系、客户运营体系，提升车险盈利能力。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：责任保险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">责任保险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入242.32亿元，同比增长4.4%；综合成本率102.7%，同比优化3.6个百分点。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">围绕金融“五篇大文章”积极布局绿色发展、制造强国、民生保障等重点板块，实现可持续高质量发展；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">在风险减量方面，持续提升风险定价模型准确性，进一步扩大适用范围；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">在产品创新方面，首创储能系统损失补偿责任保险、化学电池衰减补偿责任保险、碳汇保险等多款产品，为新质生产力发展提供有力金融支撑。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：健康保险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">健康保险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入183.28亿元，同比增长38.3%；综合成本率93.4%，同比优化1.8个百分点。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">深入执行健康中国战略，积极推动健康险发展，进一步发挥健康险在构建多层次医疗保障体系方面的补充作用；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">坚持推进“以人民健康为中心”的客户经营模式，持续深入挖掘不同年龄、地域、健康状况的客群需求，满足客户多层次的风险保障需求与多样化的健康管理需求。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row compact\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：意外伤害保险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">意外伤害保险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入122.14亿元，同比增长20.2%；综合成本率99.0%，同比优化7.0个百分点。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">积极响应国家号召，为文化旅游产业提供了有力的意外险保障；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">加大“一老一少一新”等特定人群保险保障供给力度，致力于为客户提供全场景全方面的意外风险保障。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row compact\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：农业保险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">农业保险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入107.20亿元，同比增长32.4%；综合成本率99.8%，同比优化5.7个百分点。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">在智能化作业方面，搭建精准承保、理赔数字地图，完善“防、减、救”一体的风险减量体系，切实保障农户利益；</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">在服务创新方面，持续升级“爱农宝”平台承保、理赔服务功能建设，为农户提供“三省”服务，积极探索“保险+科技”产业链智慧新模式，助力产业融合发展。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row compact\">\n      <div class=\"icon-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图标：保证保险]</div>\n        <div class=\"label\">保证保险</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p>原保险保费收入-23.53亿元；综合成本率102.2%，同比优化28.9个百分点。</p>\n        <p class=\"bullet\">保证保险未了责任余额持续下降，风险敞口快速收敛，由于存量业务理赔案件逐步回收，承保亏损同比大幅下降，对整体业务品质的影响大幅降低。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      <div class=\"footer-left\">\n        <span class=\"page-number\">40</span>\n        <span class=\"report\">二零二四年年报</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"company\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
